  "details": "There seems to be an unexpected behavior regarding the display position of the text chat.\n\nSpecifically, the situation is as follows:\n\n- Text chat from other users (remote) is displayed in the correct position.\n\n- However, text chat from myself (local) is displayed at the position as if my avatar is in a \"standing state\".\n\n- Therefore, even if I change my posture, such as crouching or lying prone, the height does not change from the \"standing position\".\n\nIf possible, I would appreciate it if this behavior could be investigated.\n\nThank you very much.\n\n*Note: The attached video is from a local multiplayer test, but this phenomenon is not limited to local multiplayer tests.*",
